<p>Your body has become a mass of living corruption, increasing your blight and acid resistance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 15%, 18%, 22%, 25%</acronym> and blight affinity by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 11%, 14%, 17%, 20%.</acronym></p><p>On taking damage greater than 15% of your maximum health, the damage will be reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 18%, 22%, 25%, 27%</acronym> and a carrion worm mass will burst forth onto a nearby tile, attacking your foes for 5 turns.</p><p>You can never have more than 5 worms active from any source at a time.</p><p>When a carrion worm dies it will explode into a radius 2 pool of blight for 5 turns, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">41, 55, 66, 75, 83</acronym> blight damage each turn and healing you for 33% of that amount.</p>